      A4 [293 tok, stop, crow-hits 0, bee-hits 0]: 'Start the chicken first; it’s the longest timer. While it roasts, mix the almond-flour biscuits and park the tray on the counter. When the chicken has 20 minutes left, slide the biscuits onto the middle rack. Once the bird comes out to rest, drop the oven to 350 °F and bake the biscuits for 12 minutes. During that window, reheat the pilaf on the stovetop and finish any veg. You’ll serve everything hot within 15 minut' ... '\n\nYou’re set. If the cornbread top browns too fast, tent it lightly with foil and give it another 3 minutes. Have a wonderful Sunday dinner!'
